            "notes": "The deck revolves around utilizing Cloud, Midgar Mercenary as the commander to lead an aggressive strategy. The deck focuses on quickly establishing board presence with a mix of efficient creatures and disruptive spells. It aims to control the battlefield by utilizing cards like Thalia, Heretic Cathar, Drannith Magistrate, and Archon of Emeria to slow down opponents' strategies while deploying threats like Skyclave Apparition and Elite Spellbinder to apply pressure. The deck also includes key equipment like Umezawa's Jitte, Sword of Fire and Ice, and Skullclamp to enhance its creatures and generate card advantage. With a strong mix of disruption, aggression, and card advantage, the deck aims to overwhelm opponents and secure victory."
